<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Жёлтый аудиоплеер</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            background: #fef9e0;
        }
        .player-card {
            background: #ffeb99;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            width: 520px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
            border: 1px solid #f7d44a;
        }
        .cover {
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            object-fit: cover;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            border: 2px solid #f7b32b;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .info {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #b85c00;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        }
        .artist {
            color: #b87333;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0 0 14px 0;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        audio {
            width: 100%;
            height: 42px;
        }
        audio::-webkit-media-controls-panel {
            background-color: #ffd966;
        }
        audio::-webkit-media-controls-current-time-display,
        audio::-webkit-media-controls-time-remaining-display {
            color: #7a4c00;
        }
        audio::-webkit-media-controls-play-button {
            background-color: #ffb347;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="player-card">
        <img class="cover" src="507dbc93ce1a9cc02d5e9c6492efa08e.jpg" alt="Обложка">
        <div class="info">
            <h2>🎵 Жёлтая мелодия</h2>
            <p class="artist">Название трека</p>
            <audio controls>
                <source src="3_06.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                Ваш браузер не поддерживает аудиоплеер
            </audio>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
